PyYAML 6.0.3 links a static build of libyaml into its extension module
yaml._yaml. Its Linux wheels are built by PyYAML's CI workflow, which checks
out https://github.com/yaml/libyaml at the tag 0.2.5 and configures it with
--enable-shared=no (packaging/build/libyaml.sh in the PyYAML source
release). The archive below is libyaml's release of that tag. libyaml is
licensed under the MIT license; its license file is in the libyaml
directory.

